    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d30">

                <pb facs="0126" n="42" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg42"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Seeger to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Petropolis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-03-03"><hi rendition="#italic">March 3,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my unnumbered dispatch to the
                    Department of February 22 and to my note to the foreign office of January 20, a
                    copy of which was transmitted with my unnumbered dispatch of January 20, I have
                    the honor to transmit herewith a copy and translation of a note from Baron Rio
                    Branco, received yesterday, in reference to the reestablishment of free transit
                    on the Amazon.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Eugene Seeger</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Consul-General, in Charge of the
                        Legation.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d30-a1.xml" xpointer="d30-a1"/>
